{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33585","headline":"题郑侍郎岩隐十韵 · 许棠","name":"题郑侍郎岩隐十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝退常归隐，真修大隐情。\n园林应得趣，岩谷自爲名。\n野步难寻寺，闲吟少在城。\n树藏幽洞黑，花照远村明。\n海石分湖路，风泉遰雨声。\n性高怜散逸，官达厌公卿。\n架引藤重长，阶延笋迸生。\n青门无到客，紫阁有来莺。\n物外身虽隐，区中望本清。\n终难依此境，坐卧避钧衡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}